Browser libraries and fonts for overlook-remote.html, unmodified but for the source map line.

- marked.js: marked 18.1.1, lib/marked.umd.js (MIT, marked-LICENSE)
- purify.js: DOMPurify 3.4.17, dist/purify.min.js (Apache-2.0 or MPL-2.0, purify-LICENSE)
- pixelify-sans-400.woff2, pixelify-sans-700.woff2: Pixelify Sans, latin subset from @fontsource/pixelify-sans 5 (OFL-1.1, pixelify-sans-LICENSE)
